  "notes_md_form": "## Preguntas con do/does\n\nPara preguntar sobre la rutina diaria, usa **do** con I, you, we, they y **does** con he, she, it. El verbo principal vuelve a su forma base: *Does she have an appointment?* (no *has*).\n\n- **Do** you check your schedule in the morning?\n- **Does** he work on the third period?\n\n## Errores comunes\n\n- ✗ *Do he works?* → ✓ **Does he work?** (el verbo no lleva -s)\n- ✗ *What time you have the meeting?* → ✓ **What time do you have the meeting?**\n\nRecuerda: **past_prep** (after) y **third_ord** (third) son tus aliados para hablar de horarios. Practica con tu propia agenda: *What do you do after work?*",
